  "consumed": "Ol' Donkey Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost Per Dose:</strong> 100eb (Premium)</p>\n<p><em>An illegal mixture of various steroid and adrenaline meds. Perfect for hoarders, piano movers, and unloading all your groceries in a single trip.</em></p>\n<p><strong>⋙</strong> <strong>PRIMARY EFFECT</strong> <strong>⋘</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lasts 4 Hours.</li>\n<li>For the duration of the Primary Effect, the user’s MOVE and REF are reduced by 1 (Minimum 1).</li>\n<li>For the duration of the Primary Effect, the user’s BODY is increased by 3 to a maximum of BODY 11. This increase in BODY does not increase the user’s HP and is not factored in when calculating their Death Save.</li>\n<li>For the duration of the Primary Effect, users with BODY 12 or higher gain a +3 bonus to any BODY-based Skill Checks.</li>\n<li>For the duration of the Primary Effect, the user does not suffer the usual -2 penalty from being in a Grapple for Brawling, Martial Arts, and Melee Weapon Skill Checks.</li>\n<li>User becomes extremely overconfident and boisterous. Do your best to roleplay accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>⋙</strong> <strong>SECONDARY EFFECT (DV17)</strong> <strong>⋘</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If the user wasn’t already addicted to Ol’ Donkey, they are now. While addicted, unless the user is experiencing the Primary Effect of Ol’ Donkey, their BODY is reduced by 3 (Minimum 1). This reduction in BODY does not decrease the user’s HP and is not factored in when calculating their Death Save.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"Ol' Donkey Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>When an addicted character doses, use \"Ol' Donkey Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
  },
